   "source": [
    "# Group Project Cryosphere\n",
    "\n",
    "Earth Observation group project about a glacier in the Himalaya in Nepal. We try to measure glacier area, surface temperature variation, and wet/total snow area using satellite data from Google Earth Engine. We investigate these aspects on the time series of 2015 - 2026.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Initializing"
   ]
  },
